{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0324_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "e22a400adb0a00c9fa8579cc4db72b5500da9285c83c580f3502b1e5797a3f71", "ja": "あとは、人間を誘惑しちゃうイメージも。\n私も、そういう妖しい魅力を出したいなーって。", "zh": "还有就是，魅惑人类的那种感觉。\n我也想展现出那种妖艳的魅力呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
